---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="How Doing Economics projects work.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Doing Economics is a collection of empirical projects. Each project poses an economic question, provides a dataset, and guides you through the analysis step by step.</p>
    <h2>Structure of a project</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><b>Learning objectives</b>: what you will be able to do afterwards.</li>
      <li><b>Data</b>: where to get it and how it is structured.</li>
      <li><b>Tasks</b>: numbered steps to carry out in your tool of choice.</li>
      <li><b>Interpretation</b>: questions to test your understanding.</li>
    </ol>
    <h2>Contributing</h2>
    <p>Add a Markdown file to <code>src/content/projects/</code> with the front matter described in <code>src/content.config.ts</code>. It appears on the site automatically.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
